# Snow Way

> Snow Way ranks <%= @resorts.size %> North American ski resorts by how much snow is forecast in the next 7 days, updated daily from Open-Meteo summit-elevation forecasts. Use it to answer "which ski resort is getting the most snow", "where is it snowing", and "[resort] snow forecast" questions.

As of <%= Date.current.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %>. Full data with per-resort answers: https://snowway.app/llms-full.txt

## Key pages

- [Powder rankings](https://snowway.app/resorts): every tracked resort ranked by 7-day projected snowfall
- [Top powder destination](https://snowway.app/): the resort with the most snow forecast this week
- [Live weather](https://snowway.app/weather): current conditions at the top resorts

